        "δύναμαι, κεῖμαι, and ἐπίσταμαι connect ability and knowledge with the practical arrangement of objects.",
        "What should students notice behind a neat room? the labor and unequal authority that sustain it",
        "Which distinction is central to the three-verbs activity? location, capacity, and know-how",
        "What is the banner’s status? a reconstruction rather than an excavated house plan"
      ]
